Package: whisper-echo-gtk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, whisper-echo (>= 0.1.0), libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0
Description: GTK4 GUI frontend for whisper-echo
 whisper-echo-gtk provides a native GNOME desktop interface to configure
 whisper-echo settings, start/stop the dictation engine, monitor live
 status and transcription, and persist preferences to ~/.whisper-echo/.
